      [
        "Keep invalid states out",
        "An invariant is a condition that must hold after every public operation. A wallet might forbid negative balances; a reservation may forbid confirmation after expiration. Hide mutable fields and expose operations that preserve these rules."
      ],
      [
        "Separate policy from orchestration",
        "A domain object owns rules about itself. An application service coordinates repositories and external systems. A repository abstracts persistence. Avoid a god object that handles pricing, SQL, payment, and notification together."
      ]
