    "example": "p99 latency rises while CPU remains at 30%. Traces show requests waiting before database execution, and connection-pool wait time grows. Adding application threads can worsen the queue. Inspect slow queries, pool occupancy, timeouts, and admission behavior; tune only after identifying why connections remain occupied.",
